    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngondo ni Asiliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya, ŵagasongenye makuga ga asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo, ŵaliji soni pa mkamulano ni acayimwene ŵane 32, ŵiŵakwete mageleta ni mahaci ga ngondo. Jwalakwejo pamo ni acayimwene acimjakwewo, ŵajawile kuja kuwusyungulila msinda wa Samaliya, ni ŵaliŵicile cile kuti ajitande ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mwenye Beni Hadadi ŵatumisye kaje ŵandu ŵakwe mu msindawo, kwa Mwenye Ahabu jwa ku Isalaeli kuti akasale maloŵe gakuti, “Mwenye Beni Hadadi akulamula kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mpelece kwa jwalakwe silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pamo ni golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwenu. Aciŵamkwenu ŵakusalala pamo ni ŵanace ŵenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahabu ŵajanjile kuti, “Mkasalile ambuje ŵangu, Mwenye Beni Hadadi kuti, une njiticisye, yindu yosope yingwete une yili yawo, pamo ni une jwakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe ŵandu ŵa utenga ŵala ŵayice soni kwa Ahabu ni maloŵe gakutyocela kwa Beni Hadadi gakusala kuti, “Namtumicisye maloŵe gakusala kuti mundumicisye uneji silifa jwenu pamo ni golidi jwenu, aciŵamkwenu pamo ni ŵanace ŵenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo, malaŵi ndaŵi mpela jinojino, tinamtumicisye asilikali ŵangu ŵa ngondo kweleko, tacijinjila m'majumba mwenu ni mwa nduna syenu, nipo tacijigala yindu yosope yitaciyiwona kuti yili yambone.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahabu ŵaŵilasile acakulungwakulungwa ŵa mcilambo mwakwe ni ŵasalile kuti, “Sambano mkulola kuti Benihadadiju akusosa kutujonanga. Ŵandumicisye maloŵe gakuti nampe aciŵamkwangu ni ŵanace ŵangu, pamo ni silifa ni golidi jwangu, nipo une najiticisye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwakulungwa ŵala pamo ni ŵandu wosope ŵatite kuti, “Akampikanila jwalakwejo, soni akasajiticisya yasasileyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Ahabu ŵasalile ŵandu ŵa mitenga ŵa Beni Hadadi ŵala kuti, “Mkasalile ambuje ŵangu, Mwenye Beni Hadadi kuti, ‘Une tinayitende yindu yosope yiŵasasile pandanda pala. Nambo yasasile sambanoyi une nganiyitenda.’ ” Ŵandu ŵamitenga ŵala ŵatyosile ni ŵajile kumsalila Beni Hadadi gele maloŵego. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi ni ŵatumisye soni maloŵe kwa Ahabu gakuti, “Tiyice ni ŵandu ŵangu ŵajinji kuwujonanga msinda wenu wa Samaliya, nipo tiwuciŵa luwunduwundupe. Milungu jimbe une cilango naga ngulepela kuyitenda yindu yeleyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Ahabu ŵajanjile kuti, “Mkasalile Mwenye Beni Hadadi kuti, msilikali msyesyene akasalilumba msyene ngondo jili jimasile, ngaŵa mkanamenyane ngondo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi ŵagapikene maloŵe gelega, ali pasikati pa yakumwa, pamo ni ayimwene ajakwe ŵala m'matenti gawo, nipo ŵasalile asilikali ŵakwe kuti aliŵicile cile kuja kuwutaga msinda wa Samaliya ngondo. Myoyo asilikali wosope ŵaliŵicile cile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jelejo jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwine ŵayice kwa Ahabu, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, kukumsalila kuti, “AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " akuti, ‘Mkalijogopa likuga lyalikulungwa lya asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa Benihadadi. Tinalipelece likuga lyeleli m'magasa genu lelo jino, nipo tim'manyilile kuti kweli une ndili AMBUJE.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ŵatapute jele ngondoji ŵani?” Jwakulocesya jula ŵajanjile kuti, “AMBUJE akusala kuti asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa acibwanamkubwa ŵenu ŵa m'maboma, ni ŵitapute jele ngondoji.” Ahabu ŵawusisye soni kuti, “Nambi ŵani ŵatiŵalongolele jemanjaji ku ngondoko?” Jwakulocesya jula ŵajanjile kuti, “M'mwejo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Ahabu ŵaŵilasile asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa mabwanamkubwa ŵa m'maboma, wosope pamo ŵapali 232. Ni ŵaŵilasile soni asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Isalaeli 7,000. Ni ŵaliŵicile cile kuja kuputa ngondo ni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi ja musi, Mwenye Ahabu ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵakopwece mu msinda wa Samaliya, ali ŵalongwesye asilikali ŵa mabwanamkubwa ŵa m'maboma ŵala. Mwenye Beni Hadadi jwa ku Siliya ni acayimwene acimjakwe 32 ŵakukamusyangana nawo ŵala, ŵaliji mkumwa mpaka kukolelwa m'matenti gawo. Ndaŵi jijojo ŵayice ku matentiko ŵandu ŵele Beni Hadadi ŵatumile kuti akasonde, ali mkugumila kuti, “Twaweni asilikali ŵa ngondo ali mkwisa kutyocela ku Samaliya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.16+1KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.16",
              "1KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi ŵalamwile kuti, “Mkakamule ŵajumi, ngangusamala kanga akwisa kumenyana ni uweji, kanga akwisa kukamula lukongolo, yeleyo yangali kandu, mkakamule ŵajumi basi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa acibwanamkubwa ŵa m'maboma ŵala ni ŵiŵajitandite kuputa ngondo, pamo ni asilikali ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵiŵaliji mkwakuya munyuma mwawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalijose jwa jemanjajo ŵamwuleje mundu jwakwe. Asiliya ŵala ŵatisile, nipo ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵala ŵakuyisye, nambo Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya, ŵakulupwice ali akwesile pa haci, pamo ni asilikali ŵane ŵakwela pa mahaci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli ŵagakamwile mahacigo pamo ni mageleta gakwe, nipo ŵapundile pa ngondo asilikali ŵa ku Siliya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe jwakulocesya jula ŵayice soni kwa Ahabu, mwenye ja ku Isalaeli, kukumsalila kuti, “Akalamuce, soni aganisye cenene yakutenda. Pakuŵa caka cikwisaci, mwenye jwa ku Siliya tayice soni kukumenyana ngondo ni ŵalakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngondo jaŵili ni Asiliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice kumangwawo, nduna sya Beni Hadadi mwenye jwa ku Siliya, syamsalile jwalakwejo kuti, “Milungu ja ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli jili milungu ja m'matumbi, ni ligongo lyakwe ŵakwete macili gakutupundila uwe pa ngondo. Nambo ulendo awuno kwende tukamenyane nawo ku ciŵata, nditu ngatuja kulepela, tukapunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ŵalakwe atende yindu ayi, ŵatyosye ucimwene, acayimwene 32 ŵala. M'malo mwawo ŵaŵice ma bwanamkubwa alamulileje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soni ŵasonganye asilikali wa ngondo ŵajinji, winji ŵakwe mpela asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵandanda ŵiŵajonasice ŵala, winji wa mahaci gaŵe mpela galagala, ni winji wa mageleta mpela galagala soni. Tukamenyane nawo Aisalaeli ulendo awuno ku ciŵata. Nditu ngatuja kulepela, tukapunde.” Mwenye Benihadadijo ŵakamulene nago maloŵe giŵaŵecete acakulungwakulungwa, nipo ŵayitesile yosopeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Picayikene caka cine cila, Beni Hadadi ŵasongenye asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya, ni ŵajawile nawo ku msinda wa Afeki, kuti akamenyane ni asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli nombe nawo ŵasongene, nipo ali amasile kupocela yida ya ngondo yakusosekwa, ŵajawile kuja kumenyana ni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya. Ŵataŵile masakasa gawo mwakulolegana ni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya. Nipo asilikali ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵagambaga kuwoneka mpela tumakuga tuŵili twa mbusi, pakwalandanya ni asilikali ŵa ku Siliya, ŵiŵagambile gumbala mbali josopejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesya jwa Mlungu ŵajawile kwa Mwenye Ahabu kukumsalila kuti, “AMBUJE akusala kuti, ‘Ligogo lyakuti ŵandu ŵa ku Siliya akuganisya kuti AMBUJE ali mlungu jwa ku matumbi, ngaŵa jwa ku ciŵata, tinalipelece likuga lyosopeli lya asilikali ŵa ku Siliya m'magasa mwenu, nipo m'mwejo ni ŵandu ŵenu tim'manyilile kuti Une ndili AMBUJE.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jeleji ni kuti asilikali ŵa ku Isalaeli ni ŵa ku Siliya ŵaliji m'masakasa mwawo mwakulolegana kwa masiku msano ni gaŵili. Pa lisiku lya msano ni gaŵili, ngondo jatandite. Nipo lyuŵa mkanilikapile, asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵawuleje asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Siliya 100,000. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵakusigala ŵatilile mu msinda ŵa Afeki, nipo lipupa lyagwilile asilikali ŵa ku Siliya 27,000 ŵiŵasigelewo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi nombe najo ŵatilile mu msinda wa Afeki, ni wajuŵile mcipinda ca kunyuma ca nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo nduna syakwe syamsalile kuti, “Ŵakucimbicika mwenye ŵetu, uwe tupikene kuti acayimwene ŵa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ali ŵacanasa. Atukunde kuti tujawule kwa mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli tuli tuwete yiguduli mciwunu mwetu, ni kusyenga ngonji mlukosi mwetu, nipo tukamŵende Ahabu kuti akawulaga ŵalakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu ŵala ŵawete yiguduli mciwunu mwawo, ŵasyenjile ngonji mlukosi mwawo, nipo ŵajawile kwa Ahabu mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Jwakutumicila jwenu Beni Hadadi akuŵenda, ‘Conde mkamwulaga.’ ” Ahabu ŵawusisye kuti, “Ana ali cijumi? Jwejula, ali mlongo mjangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nduna sya Beni Hadadi sila syaliji mkwembeceya kuti apikane yitaŵecete Ahabu. Piŵapikene maloŵe gakuŵeceta Ahabu gakuti, “Ali mlongo mjangu.” Ŵajanjile mwacitemacitema kuti, “Yakuwona, Beni Hadadi ali mlongo mjawo ŵalakwe.” Myoyo Ahabu ŵatite kuti, “Jawulani mkamjigale ayice akuno.” Piŵayice Benihadadi, Ahabu ŵamkwesisye jwalakwe pa ligeleta lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beni Hadadi ŵamsalile Ahabu kuti, “Misinda josope jele baba ŵangu ŵasumwile baba ŵenu tinajiwucisye kwa m'mwejo. Myoyo mkukomboleka kuja kutaŵa ma sitolo ku Damasiko, mpela muŵataŵile masitolo baba ŵangu ku Samaliya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu ŵajanjile kuti, “Naga mkutenda yimsasileyi, une tinamkunde kuti mjawuleje kumangwenu.” Myoyo ŵaŵisile cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni Benihadadi, ni ŵamkundile kuti ajawuleje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesya akumjamuka Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line AMBUJE ŵamlamwile jumo jwa ŵakulocesya, kuti amsalile jwakulocesya mjakwe kuti ampute jwalakwe. Nambo jwalakwejo ŵakanile kumputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo jwakulocesya jula ŵasasile kuti, “Ligongo lyakuti nganimpikanila maloŵe ga AMBUJE, lisimba tilimwulaje m'mwejo, patimgambe kutyoka apano.” Ni kweli piŵagambile kutyoka pa malopo, ŵasimene ni lisimba nipo lya mwuleje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 13:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwakulocesya jula ŵajawile kwa jwakulocesya jwine soni ni ŵamsalile kuti, “Mjangu, conde mumbute.” Mjakwe jula kweli ŵamputile mpaka ŵamkatile ku ngope pakumputapo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesya jula ŵajisyenjile ngope jakwe ni nguwo, kulisisa kuti akamanyicila, nipo ŵajawile kuja kwima mungulugulu msewu, kwajembeceya mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli kuti apite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jiŵapitaga mwenye piŵajimi jwakulocesya jula, jwakulocesyajo ŵagumisile kuti, “Ŵakucimbicika mwenye, une jwakutumicila jwenu najile kuja kujijinjilila ngondo pasikati pasyesyene. Nipo msilikali jumo jwa ngondo ŵayice kwa une ni mundu jumo jwa m'magongo jwetu, ni ŵasalile une kuti, ‘Mumsunje mundu aju. Nambo naga akutila, tinjimwulaga m'mwejo kapena timcilipila mbiya sya silifa 3,000.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo une pinaliji mkujijilika kamula masengo gane, mundujo ŵatisile.” Mwenye Ahabu ŵamjanjile jwakulocesyajo kuti, “Timpocele cilango m'mwejo, mpela mumŵecetele pemo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesya jula ŵapapwile nguwo jiŵasyenjile ngope jakwe, nipo Ahabu ŵam'manyilile kuti ali jumo jwa ŵakulocesya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakulocesyajo ŵamsalile Ahabu kuti, “AMBUJE akusala kuti, ‘Pakuŵa mumkundile Benihadadi, jwele junamlamwile kuti mumwulaje, kuti ajawuleje. Sambano m'mwejo ni ŵatimwulajidwe m'malo mwa jwalakwe, ni ŵandu ŵenu taciwulajidwa m'malo mwa ŵandu ŵakwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
